00:25:00.000 --> 00:25:03.756
Under this partnership with AWS as the lead multiplier,

00:25:04.156 --> 00:25:10.956
NTUC and AWS will support 100 companies
in their business transformation,

00:25:10.956 --> 00:25:18.316
or at least 100 companies in their The transformation
and expand access of AI skills for ten thousand workers.

00:25:18.996 --> 00:25:26.076
So this, to me is a practical example of Singapore's
tripartite model in action, where the government,

00:25:26.236 --> 00:25:31.156
businesses and unions alike work together
to deliver coordinated outcomes.

00:25:31.236 --> 00:25:39.436
So I encourage businesses and firms who are here today
to work with AWS, to work with NTUC, to transform your business,

00:25:39.436 --> 00:25:45.116
to upskill your workers so that we can progress
together in an AI driven economy.

00:25:46.356 --> 00:25:49.596
I have mentioned about vision and execution.

00:25:49.796 --> 00:25:54.556
And the third factor in my mind is perhaps
the most important is values.

00:25:55.196 --> 00:25:59.916
Technology must be anchored in trust, fairness, and inclusion.

00:26:00.276 --> 00:26:05.076
And as AI becomes more powerful, trust becomes a real advantage.

00:26:05.636 --> 00:26:09.756
Companies move faster when they are confident
about governance and security.

00:26:10.076 --> 00:26:15.036
Individuals are more willing to adopt
AI when they trust how it is being used.

00:26:15.596 --> 00:26:21.236
We must also hold firmly to our commitment to leaving no one behind.

00:26:21.596 --> 00:26:29.156
As we race ahead with artificial intelligence,
AI should not result in jobless growth, and productivity.

00:26:29.156 --> 00:26:32.436
Gains should never come at the expense of our workers.

00:26:32.716 --> 00:26:40.196
This is why Singapore's tripartite model
remains so important and ensures that our businesses,

00:26:40.436 --> 00:26:44.396
our workers and the government move forward together.

00:26:45.076 --> 00:26:52.556
Our principle must be clear that our progress should be inclusive
and growth should always, always uplift our people.

00:26:53.916 --> 00:26:58.956
Let me conclude. AI is the defining technology of our generation.

00:26:58.996 --> 00:27:01.996
The opportunity it presents is significant.

00:27:02.636 --> 00:27:10.036
Realising it depends on how we as a community,
as industries and partners work together across government,

00:27:10.036 --> 00:27:15.396
industry and our broader ecosystem
to Translate capability into real outcomes.

00:27:15.876 --> 00:27:19.636
If we act now, if companies adopt AI with intent.

00:27:19.956 --> 00:27:26.036
Workers learn with confidence.
And if innovation is guided by strong values.

00:27:26.356 --> 00:27:32.436
AI can be both quietly powerful and also visibly transformative.

00:27:32.796 --> 00:27:35.756
The key, the key, really is to start now.

00:27:36.436 --> 00:27:42.596
Let us embrace AI that is guided by vision,
executed with discipline and grounded in values.

00:27:42.796 --> 00:27:46.316
Thank you, and I wish everybody a fruitful summit ahead.

00:27:46.316 --> 00:27:46.836
Thank you.

00:28:05.076 --> 00:28:06.836
Thank you, DSG Tan.

00:28:08.356 --> 00:28:13.756
This partnership means we leave no Singaporeans behind.

00:28:14.236 --> 00:28:20.916
This is not just words. It is a commitment
that we have all come together to make.

00:28:22.716 --> 00:28:32.556
These organisations that you see on the screen, they are the customers
and partners of AWS who are already embracing AI with us.

00:28:37.876 --> 00:28:44.716
In the words of our Amazon CEO Andy Jassy,
progress is rarely a straight line.

00:28:45.596 --> 00:28:54.916
AWS is your strategic enabler. The secure foundation
and the committed partner ready to navigate those twists

00:28:54.916 --> 00:28:59.836
and turns with you. Let's lead Singapore's AI future together.

00:29:00.716 --> 00:29:03.276
Thank you and have a great time at the summit.

00:29:04.076 --> 00:29:04.956
And for now,

00:29:06.236 --> 00:29:07.956
I'd like to invite on stage.

00:29:08.276 --> 00:29:14.716
Mr. Jaime Vallés, vice president and managing director of AWS, APJC.

00:29:15.276 --> 00:29:22.756
He will show us how AI agents are going
to reshape the way we build and operate.

00:29:23.556 --> 00:29:26.356
Without delay. Jaime, please.

00:29:45.756 --> 00:29:50.636
Good morning. Thank you. Priscilla. It's quite an incredible story.

00:29:51.356 --> 00:29:56.356
12 billion invested, 15 years of building together.

00:29:56.756 --> 00:30:00.000
And the organizations you just saw are proof
that Singapore isn't just adopting AI.

